TEST 29770 -- UDP broadcast helper
===========================================================================
Run: 2026-09-22 13:06:22  tb470
The case has no steps in ck.db. Tested as the feature the title names:
the DUT relays a directed/limited UDP broadcast from one VLAN to a
configured helper address in another, for the UDP ports it is told to relay.

