--- send a limited broadcast to udp/5100 into vlan1 ---
    If the helper relays it, the frame is re-originated toward 10.10.10.2
    (the AR4050S across the vlan10 transit), i.e. it leaves via po1, NOT
    flooded out the vlan1 observation port.
