=== RETEST: point the helper at an address on a path we can CAPTURE ===
helper-address 10.38.215.65 = tb470 eth3, reached stack -> po1 (vlan10 transit) -> 4050 -> eth3.
A relayed copy must appear there as a UNICAST to 10.38.215.65:5100.
The original broadcast still floods inside vlan1 -- that is not the question.

